<#
.SYNOPSIS

Delete AI agent asynchronously

.DESCRIPTION

This API deletes an AI agent machine identity. It applies only to AI agents. Application machine identities return `400`; delete them with the delete machine identity API instead.  When the AI agent was aggregated from a source and still exists on that source, the API starts a deletion task on the source and returns the task status. When the AI agent was created manually or no longer exists on the source, the API deletes it immediately and returns `200` with an empty body.  The API returns `400` when the AI agent is still assigned to machine accounts, or when its source does not support deleting it. It returns `404` when the machine identity or its source is not found. 

